<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>RadarVector – third-party licenses</title>
<style>body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:900px;margin:2em auto;padding:0 1em}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f4f4f4;padding:1em}</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>RadarVector is licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. It bundles data from the
<a href="https://github.com/vatsimnetwork/vatspy-data-project">VAT-Spy Data Project</a> and the
<a href="https://github.com/vatsimnetwork/simaware-tracon-project">SimAware TRACON Project</a>
(© their contributors, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC-BY-SA-4.0</a>) and
Natural Earth (public domain). It uses the following Rust crates:</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>License texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>{{#each used_by}}<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
